# Coupled packages/routing candidate. The former trafficshaper and freeradius3
# recursive dependencies were fixed upstream by 8e912e91d and 7933a6fe8e.
# Keep this on an isolated branch until full feed installation, defconfig and
# the stock image gates all pass together.
